 like to
> move forward with the project. To do that, I=E2=80=99d like to ask if any=
one would
> like to volunteer to work with me.
>

What other help needed? Personally I have in my ToDo updating the
translation to make it easier to read by using less complex words and
constructs. What is the deadline?

